{"id":1782697,"retrievedAt":"2026-09-28T18:52:25.767Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"","id":1782697,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"The end.","overview":"An atmospheric psychological horror short film about guilt, memory, and the terrifying space between death and acceptance- an interpretation on the in between of life and death. The film begins as a mystery. A man wakes on a cliff. He doesn't know where he is. He doesn't know who he is. And he isn't alone. What initially appears to be a supernatural mystery becomes something more intimate and disturbing: guilt and accountability. Time doesn't move. The landscape loops. Objects appear without explanation. Notes are written in handwriting the characters don't remember producing. And always, there is the ocean. The film is designed to feel minimal, cinematic and deeply unsettling, relying on atmosphere, sound and performance rather than conventional horror spectacle.","popularity":0,"poster_path":null,"production_companies":[{"id":293718,"logo_path":null,"name":"Unobtrusive Films","origin_country":""}],"production_countries":[{"iso_3166_1":"NZ","name":"New Zealand"}],"release_date":"","revenue":0,"runtime":15,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"English","iso_639_1":"en","name":"English"}],"status":"Post Production","tagline":"After waking on an isolated cliff with no memory of who he is or how he got there, a young man encounters a mysterious woman suffering from the same amnesia.","title":"The end.","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[],"crew":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":6105517,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Antoine Audonnet","original_name":"Antoine Audonnet","popularity":0.3987,"profile_path":"/6ICecQEtSRcvwSdFBAZYBkUVVcQ.jpg","credit_id":"6aba3c1388737513e3ddc003","department":"Writing","job